+## Use it in the browser
+
+```sh
+python3 web/io/serve.py          # or: python3 web/io/serve.py 8080 to use another port
+```
+
+Then open <http://127.0.0.1:8000/io/index.html> (with a port given, use it in place of 8000).
+This is the spreadsheet: Open a `.json` or `.csv` file (or start typing in the empty sheet), edit cells
+in the grid or the formula bar, and Save JSON or Save CSV. Formulas are computed by the same engine as
+`./engine`. Stop the server with Ctrl+C. More in [web/io/README.md](web/io/README.md).
+
 ## Layout
 
 - `engine`: the CLI launcher; `src/cli.py` reads and writes the workbook JSON.
