 # web/grid
 
 The spreadsheet grid: `grid.js`, a plain ES module (no build step, no libraries), and `grid.css`.
-`index.html` shows it on a sample workbook: serve the repo (`python3 -m http.server`) and open `/web/grid/`.
+To use the spreadsheet, start the app as the top-level [README.md](../../README.md) says
+(`python3 web/io/serve.py`, then <http://127.0.0.1:8000/io/index.html>).
+`index.html` here is only a demo of the grid alone, with no engine: formulas stay as typed text.
 
